## Context
Child 2 of tracker 1100 (about 3.5 agent-h, 0.4 author-h). Plan of record: docs/discussions/2026-10-14-1096-design.md. Split on 2026-10-20 into two PRs; this ticket is now a tracker and closes only after both children merge and their union is verified.

## Children
- 1153 (1143a): the shrink. No dependency on 1142. Body split into a core plus references, a test that gaze never returns APPROVED, deletion of the old battery and `agents/gaze-pr-review.md`, callers updated.
- 1154 (1143b): execute-the-plan, controller-written request/response files, transport preflight with detached fallback, validated return schema, `mode=code|prose|both`, portable simplify as a declared seat. Blocked-by 1142.

## Scope (from the 1100 plan table)
Gaze rebuilt as the review entry: inline, transport preflight with detached fallback, controller-written artifacts, validated return schema; `mode=code|prose|both`; gaze never returns APPROVED ("gaze reviews, verify-gate gates"); review-pr's code panel becomes the code mode; the old battery and `agents/gaze-pr-review.md` are deleted; portable simplify is a declared seat.

## Exit criteria (carried over; each is met by the child named)
- [x] A test shows gaze never returns APPROVED; verify-gate remains the gate (1153)
- [x] The old battery and `agents/gaze-pr-review.md` are gone with no alias; callers (hunt, raid, merge, verify-gate, dashboard) updated and grep-proven (1153)
- [x] Gaze's body is split into a core plus references so it stops being a 57 KB resident-on-invoke document (this also satisfies ticket 1131's gaze part and unblocks ticket 1130's gaze history removal) (1153)
- [x] Gaze executes the plan through controller-written request/response files, with transport preflight, detached fallback and a validated return schema (1154): DEFERRED to the dyne format by the author on 2026-10-21; 1154 closed as superseded, design kept on tracker 1100
- [x] Catalog regenerated and drift check clean in each child PR; each PR under the 15-file breaker, else split
- [x] Integration of 1153 and 1154 verified before this tracker closes
